{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HjkZVjPYTa3jkcLzBkriEJ","type":"tool_result","content":"1\ttier: worst\n2\tnarrative_guidance: 'Pivot到三个互补angle: (1) Efficiency equivalence——CLS用1-token output达到CWM\n3\t  N-token 相同accuracy，inference cost降低3-10x (GPU场景更显著); (2) Oracle characterization——\n4\t  empirically grounded decision framework for when per-test helps (T≥2, regression  rate≥10%,\n5\t  block-correlated errors); (3) Error complementarity——CLS/CWM failure modes 系统性互补（CLS漏报75.5%,\n6\t  CWM误报83.1%），oracle ensemble 90.63%，suggesting formulation  diversity as verification\n7\t  strategy。不再claim ''classification is better''，改为 ''classification and generation\n8\t  are complementary formulations with predictable failure  modes''。仍冲EMNLP main作为empirical\n9\t  characterization paper（类似analysis track）， fallback Findings。Repo-level evidence不足：multi-seed\n10\t  mean accuracy 77-79%，seed间 variance 4-6pp，reviewer会要求额外seed或质疑prompt设计。DeepSeek实验显示不同pattern，\n11\t  削弱architecture-independence claim——改为honest reporting \"gap is architecture-dependent,  further\n12\t  investigation needed\"。Per-test diagnostic value降级为theoretical argument  with oracle\n13\t  ceiling analysis（无re-repair实证）。\n14\t\n15\t  '\n16\timagined_experiments:\n17\t- name: Diagnostic Re-repair Experiment\n18\t  plan_id: diagnostic-rerepair\n19\t  description: '给修复代理提供per-test failure predictions vs 无per-test信息， 在200个instances上比较resolve\n20\t    rate。使用SWE-agent框架， classification模型提供per-test诊断。\n21\t\n22\t    '\n23\t  expected_results:\n24\t    baseline_resolve_rate_pct: 29.0\n25\t    with_diagnostic_resolve_rate_pct: 29.5\n26\t    resolve_rate_gain_pp: 0.5\n27\t    gain_significant_at_005: false\n28\t    mcnemar_p_value: 0.72\n29\t    instances_helped_by_diagnostic: 5\n30\t    instances_hurt_by_diagnostic: 4\n31\t    net_helped: 1\n32\t    diagnostic_precision_on_helped: 0.8\n33\t    diagnostic_precision_on_hurt: 0.6\n34\t    oracle_diagnostic_resolve_rate_pct: 33.5\n35\t    oracle_vs_baseline_gain_pp: 4.5\n36\t    oracle_vs_predicted_gap_pp: 4.0\n37\t    time_cost_per_instance_baseline_min: 8.2\n38\t    time_cost_per_instance_diagnostic_min: 8.5\n39\t    T1_instances_in_200: 137\n40\t    T1_gain_pp: 0.0\n41\t    T2plus_instances_in_200: 63\n42\t    T2plus_gain_pp: 1.6\n43\t  result_rationale: 'Worst档假设\"无downstream re-repair实验，per-test diagnostic value仅为theoretical  argument\"。即使勉强跑完实验，gain仅+0.5pp（29.5%\n44\t    vs 29.0%），原因： (1) 200个instances中~137个(68.7%)是T=1，per-test信息与trajectory-level数学等价，\n45\t    诊断信号零增益； (2) 剩余63个T≥2 instances中，per-test prediction precision ~80%意味着每5个predicted-fail\n46\t    中约1个是误报——修复代理基于错误诊断做了无效修复尝试（4个instances被误导）； (3) 仅5个instances中诊断真正帮助定位了具体失败测试并引导修复成功——但这些大多是\n47\t    T=2且两个测试failure mode清晰分离的\"easy\"案例； (4) Oracle上界（33.5%）显示per-test信息在完美条件下有价值（+4.5pp），但predicted  diagnostic仅能实现11%的oracle\n48\t    ceiling（0.5/4.5）； (5) McNemar p=0.72，远不显著——200个instances的power不足以检测<1pp的差异。 这个结果在worst档叙事中将Claim\n49\t    2完全降级为theoretical argument。\n50\t\n51\t    '\n52\t  tables:\n53\t  - caption: 'Diagnostic re-repair: predicted vs oracle per-test information'\n54\t    columns:\n55\t    - Condition\n56\t    - Resolve Rate (%)\n57\t    - Δ vs Baseline (pp)\n58\t    - p-value\n59\t    rows:\n60\t    - - No diagnostic (baseline)\n61\t      - 29.0\n62\t      - —\n63\t      - —\n64\t    - - Predicted per-test diagnostic\n65\t      - 29.5\n66\t      - '+0.5'\n67\t      - '0.72'\n68\t    - - Oracle per-test (ceiling)\n69\t      - 33.5\n70\t      - '+4.5'\n71\t      - '0.02'\n72\t  - caption: Re-repair gain stratified by F2P test count\n73\t    columns:\n74\t    - T bucket\n75\t    - N instances\n76\t    - Baseline resolve %\n77\t    - Diagnostic resolve %\n78\t    - Δ pp\n79\t    rows:\n80\t    - - T=1\n81\t      - 137\n82\t      - 30.7\n83\t      - 30.7\n84\t      - '0.0'\n85\t    - - T=2\n86\t      - 40\n87\t      - 25.0\n88\t      - 27.5\n89\t      - '+2.5'\n90\t    - - T≥3\n91\t      - 23\n92\t      - 21.7\n93\t      - 21.7\n94\t      - '0.0'\n95\t    - - All\n96\t      - 200\n97\t      - 29.0\n98\t      - 29.5\n99\t      - '+0.5'\n100\t  figures_description:"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01XhGdAB7rLhJYE9F5kMPZRc","session_id":"9d47b78a-b580-467b-a50b-701a5443a345","uuid":"ed313244-c0c0-4cf0-964c-218e99c8c5e1","timestamp":"2026-05-16T15:26:07.517Z"}
