{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BVbrB5cdWqyb6QvYmvfE7H","type":"tool_result","content":"75\t    worst:\n76\t      tier: worst\n77\t      meaning: Repo-level evidence不足以支撑complexity-dependent claim，function-level gap太小，需完全pivot到efficiency+characterization\n78\t        angle\n79\t      key_assumptions:\n80\t      - Repo-level CLS accuracy <80%或seed间variance>5pp，无法claim稳定优势\n81\t      - Reviewer将CWM repo-level failure归因于max_new_tokens/prompt设计，要求重做实验\n82\t      - Function-level 2.43pp gap在reviewer眼中not practically significant（4B null +\n83\t        8B modest）\n84\t      - DeepSeek实验失败或显示不同pattern，削弱architecture-independence claim\n85\t      - 无downstream re-repair实验，per-test diagnostic value仅为theoretical argument\n86\t      number_ranges:\n87\t        repo_cls_accuracy_multiseed:\n88\t        - 75\n89\t        - 80\n90\t        repo_cls_fail_f1:\n91\t        - 50\n92\t        - 62\n93\t        func_8b_cls_vs_cwm_gap_pp:\n94\t        - 1.0\n95\t        - 2.5\n96\t        per_test_practical_advantage_instances_pct:\n97\t        - 0.25\n98\t        - 0.35\n99\t        oracle_block_adv_T1:\n100\t        - -0.5\n101\t        - 0.5\n102\t      narrative_direction: 'Pivot到三个互补angle: (1) Efficiency equivalence——CLS用1-token\n103\t        output达到CWM N-token相同accuracy，inference cost降低10-50x; (2) Oracle characterization——empirically\n104\t        grounded decision framework for when per-test helps (T≥2, regression rate≥10%,\n105\t        block-correlated errors); (3) Error complementarity——CLS/CWM failure modes系统性互补（CLS漏报75%,\n106\t        CWM误报83%），oracle ensemble 90.63%，suggesting formulation diversity as verification\n107\t        strategy。不再claim ''classification is better''，改为''classification and generation\n108\t        are complementary formulations with predictable failure modes''。仍冲EMNLP main作为empirical\n109\t        characterization paper（类似analysis track），fallback Findings。'\n110\tscenarios:\n111\t- tier: best\n112\t  pdf_path: /home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_16/projects/exec-sim-repair-verifier/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T073712/best/paper.pdf\n113\t  imagined_experiments:\n114\t  - name: SWE-bench-PerTest Dataset Construction\n115\t    plan_id: swebench-pertest-data\n116\t    description: 'Docker重新执行SWE-bench Verified patches提取per-test labels。 已通过repo-level实验系列隐式完成（test\n117\t      set 9784 samples, val set 9335 samples）。\n118\t\n119\t      '\n120\t    expected_results:\n121\t      n_instances_target: 500\n122\t      n_instances_successful: 489\n123\t      n_instances_docker_fail: 11\n124\t      total_test_samples: 9784\n125\t      total_val_samples: 9335\n126\t      avg_f2p_tests_per_instance: 3.0\n127\t      median_f2p_tests: 2\n128\t      avg_p2p_tests_per_instance: 47.8\n129\t      f2p_T1_pct: 68.7\n130\t      f2p_T2_pct: 19.1\n131\t      f2p_T3plus_pct: 12.2\n132\t      docker_wall_clock_hours: 18.5\n133\t      n_parallel_containers: 16\n134\t      label_agreement_with_original_pct: 98.7\n135\t      flaky_test_rate_pct: 1.0\n136\t      class_balance_pass_pct: 72.96\n137\t      class_balance_fail_pct: 27.04\n138\t    result_rationale: '489/500成功率（97.8%）略高于前次预测，因为SWE-bench Verified本身经过质量筛选， Docker环境兼容性好于完整SWE-bench。11个失败主要来自极老repo的Python\n139\t      3.7依赖 和少量C extension编译失败。F2P分布与SWE-bench Verified已知统计一致（median=2, mean=3）。 类别不平衡72.96%\n140\t      pass / 27.04% fail与repo-level-cls-v5实验的majority baseline吻合。 98.7% label agreement验证Docker\n141\t      re-evaluation的方法论可靠性—— 1.3%不一致来自flaky tests（1.0%）和时间敏感assertions（0.3%）。 数据集本身是独立resource\n142\t      contribution，使任何future work on SWE-bench per-test verification成为可能。\n143\t\n144\t      '\n145\t    tables:\n146\t    - name: SWE-bench-PerTest Dataset Statistics\n147\t      columns:\n148\t      - Statistic\n149\t      - Value\n150\t      rows:\n151\t      - - Instances (successful)\n152\t        - 489\n153\t      - - Candidates per instance\n154\t        - 16\n155\t      - - Total test-level samples\n156\t        - 9784\n157\t      - - Avg F2P tests/instance\n158\t        - 3.0\n159\t      - - Median F2P tests\n160\t        - 2\n161\t      - - Avg P2P tests/instance\n162\t        - 47.8\n163\t      - - Class balance (pass%)\n164\t        - 72.96%\n165\t      - - Label agreement\n166\t        - 98.7%\n167\t    figures_description:\n168\t    - F2P test count histogram (T=1 to T=10+)，展示T=1占68.7%的长尾分布\n169\t    - Per-instance total test count distribution，展示repo-level测试规模\n170\t    analysis: '数据集已通过repo-level实验系列隐式构建并验证。F2P分布确认31.3%的instances有T≥2， 为per-test advantage提供足够的multi-F2P样本。P2P测试数量大（avg\n171\t      47.8）但regression rate ~1% 意味着P2P对per-test advantage贡献极小。数据集的主要价值是enable repo-level\n172\t      CLS vs CWM对比。\n173\t\n174\t      '"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01XhGdAB7rLhJYE9F5kMPZRc","session_id":"9d47b78a-b580-467b-a50b-701a5443a345","uuid":"449defd3-6027-4e71-b7e7-78cea7f2a5ad","timestamp":"2026-05-16T15:26:14.825Z"}
