{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_017YWZkXaDY2i6NnDZWJYZY4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  大幅 reframe 为 'The Formulation Design Space for Neural Code Verification'。\n  核心假设不泛化：DeepSeek repo CWM unparseable 仅 ~12%（远低于 Qwen 的 53-93%），\n  且 CWM accuracy 与 CLS 相当甚至略优，证明 Qwen repo-level CWM 崩溃是 Qwen tokenizer 特定弱点，\n  而非 generation formulation 的通用问题。Function-level DeepSeek CLS-CWM gap 仅 +0.03pp（2-seed mean），\n  进一步确认 complexity-dependent advantage 是 Qwen-specific artifact。\n  Pivot 路径组合 A+B+C：(A) Efficiency——CLS 1-token vs CWM N-token 精度相当时有 throughput 优势；\n  (B) Error complementarity 升级为第一 contribution；(C) 首个 3-formulation × 2-model-family 系统比较。\n  C1 降格为 Qwen case study，C3 oracle frontier 升级为主 contribution。\n  仍冲 EMNLP Findings，但需显著加强 analytical writing 和 error taxonomy 深度。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"SWE-bench-PerTest Dataset Construction\"\n    plan_id: \"swebench-pertest-data\"\n    description: >\n      Docker re-evaluation of SWE-bench Verified patches 提取 per-test labels。\n      已通过 repo-level 实验系列隐式完成（test 9784, val 9335）。\n      此实验为 infrastructure，不受 tier 影响。\n    expected_results:\n      n_instances_successful: 489\n      n_instances_docker_fail: 11\n      total_test_samples: 9784\n      total_val_samples: 9335\n      avg_f2p_tests_per_instance: 3.0\n      median_f2p_tests: 2\n      f2p_T1_pct: 68.7\n      f2p_T2_pct: 19.1\n      f2p_T3plus_pct: 12.2\n      class_balance_pass_pct: 72.96\n      class_balance_fail_pct: 27.04\n      docker_wall_clock_hours: 18.5\n      label_agreement_with_original_pct: 98.7\n    result_rationale: >\n      数据集构建是确定性 infrastructure 工作，不受模型性能 tier 影响。489/500 成功率来自\n      SWE-bench Verified 的质量筛选保障；11 个失败源于极老 repo 的 Python 3.7 依赖和\n      C extension 编译问题。F2P 分布（median=2, mean=3）与 SWE-bench Verified 已知统计一致。\n      类别不平衡 72.96% pass 与 repo-level-cls-v5 的 majority baseline 吻合。\n      在 worst tier 下，数据集本身仍是有价值的 resource contribution——\n      区别在于基于此数据集训练的模型表现如何。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"SWE-bench-PerTest Dataset Statistics\"\n        columns: [\"Statistic\", \"Value\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Instances (successful)\", 489]\n          - [\"Total test-level samples\", 9784]\n          - [\"F2P T=1 instances\", \"68.7%\"]\n          - [\"F2P T≥2 instances\", \"31.3%\"]\n          - [\"Class balance (pass%)\", \"72.96%\"]\n          - [\"Label agreement\", \"98.7%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"F2P test count histogram（T=1 到 T=10+），T=1 占 68.7% 的长尾分布\"\n    analysis: >\n      数据集在所有 tier 下表现一致。但在 worst tier 的叙事中，它的角色从 'enabling CLS advantage demonstration'\n      转变为 'enabling systematic formulation comparison'——即 empirical characterization 而非 claim validation。\n\n  - name: \"DeepSeek Repo-Level CLS Training & Evaluation\"\n    plan_id: \"deepseek-cls-repo\"\n    description: >\n      DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B LoRA classification 在 SWE-bench-PerTest repo-level 数据上训练。\n      seq_length=8192。验证 CLS formulation 是否在 Qwen 之外的 model family 同样有效。\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy: 63.5\n      f1_macro: 55.2\n      f1_fail: 38.7\n      f1_pass: 71.8\n      precision_fail: 42.3\n      recall_fail: 35.7\n      precision_pass: 70.1\n      recall_pass: 73.6\n      majority_baseline: 72.96\n      gap_vs_majority_pp: -9.46\n      unparseable_pct: 1.8\n      best_checkpoint: \"checkpoint-400\"\n      training_loss_final: 0.48\n      eval_loss_best: 0.52\n      overfitting_observed: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst tier 核心假设：ds_repo_cls_acc_pct ∈ [55, 70]。预测 63.5% 的理由：\n      (1) DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B 虽在代码理解上强于 Qwen-4B，但 repo-level context 的\n      长序列推理仍是本质难题——Qwen-4B 最佳也仅 83.6%（ckpt4600, val5120），\n      而 DeepSeek 缺乏 Qwen 在 thinking mode 下的 chain-of-thought 优势；\n      (2) DeepSeek tokenizer 对 Python 代码的 token 效率略低于 Qwen3 tokenizer，\n      同等 seq_length 下能容纳的有效上下文更少；\n      (3) LoRA rank=16 对 6.7B 模型的参数覆盖率低于对 4B 模型，\n      导致 adaptation 不充分——这与 Qwen-8B repo-level（ckpt200 仅 63.5%，需大量 step）一致；\n      (4) 63.5% 低于 majority baseline 73%，意味着模型实质上在 randomly guessing\n      minority class，fail_f1 仅 38.7% 反映了极度不平衡的预测分布。\n      这个结果的最大影响：repo-level CLS 并非 universally effective，\n      需要 model-specific tuning，削弱 'CLS as general formulation' 的 claim。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"DeepSeek Repo-Level CLS vs Qwen Repo-Level CLS\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"Accuracy\", \"Fail F1\", \"Pass F1\", \"vs Majority\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Qwen3-4B (ckpt4600)\", \"82.35%\", \"60.87%\", \"88.60%\", \"+9.39pp\"]\n          - [\"Qwen3-8B (ckpt1000)\", \"88.23%*\", \"73.00%*\", \"92.50%*\", \"+15.27pp*\"]\n          - [\"DeepSeek-6.7B (worst)\", \"63.5%\", \"38.7%\", \"71.8%\", \"-9.46pp\"]\n        note: \"* val set numbers; test 可能更低\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"三模型 repo-level accuracy 对比柱状图，DeepSeek 低于 majority baseline 的 red line\"\n      - \"Checkpoint sweep 学习曲线：DeepSeek 过拟合早于 Qwen\"\n    analysis: >\n      DeepSeek repo-level CLS 远低于 Qwen 同级别模型，且低于 majority baseline，\n      证明 CLS formulation 的有效性高度依赖 base model 的 code understanding 能力分布。\n      这直接挑战 C1 的 'classification scales better with complexity' claim——\n      它仅在 Qwen 家族上成立。在 worst tier 叙事中，此结果被重新解读为\n      'formulation effectiveness is model-contingent'，强化 empirical characterization 价值。\n\n  - name: \"DeepSeek Repo-Level CWM Training & Evaluation\"\n    plan_id: \"deepseek-cwm-repo\"\n    description: >\n      DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B LoRA CWM generation 在 SWE-bench-PerTest repo-level 上训练。\n      Worst tier 关键翻转：CWM 在 DeepSeek 上 unparseable rate 极低（<15%），\n      证明 Qwen CWM 崩溃是 tokenizer-specific 而非 formulation-inherent。\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy: 65.6\n      f1_macro: 50.8\n      f1_fail: 30.2\n      f1_pass: 71.4\n      precision_fail: 35.9\n      recall_fail: 26.1\n      precision_pass: 69.8\n      recall_pass: 73.0\n      majority_baseline: 72.96\n      gap_vs_majority_pp: -7.36\n      unparseable_pct: 11.8\n      unparseable_count: 1155\n      exact_match_rate: 42.3\n      truncated_pct: 3.2\n      best_checkpoint: \"checkpoint-500\"\n      max_new_tokens: 512\n      ds_repo_cls_cwm_gap_pp: -2.1\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst tier 核心假设：ds_repo_cwm_unparseable_pct ∈ [0, 15]，ds_repo_cls_cwm_gap ∈ [-5, 5]。\n      预测 unparseable 仅 11.8% 的理由：\n      (1) DeepSeek-Coder 是专门在大量代码执行 trace 上预训练的，其 tokenizer 对\n      stdout/stderr 格式化输出的编码效率远高于 Qwen3——后者是通用 chat model；\n      (2) Qwen repo-level CWM 失败的核心原因是 Qwen tokenizer 将执行输出中的\n      数字、特殊字符、traceback 格式编码为极多 token（如 v10 的 93% unparseable），\n      而 DeepSeek-Coder tokenizer 的代码 vocab 覆盖了这些 pattern；\n      (3) 11.8% unparseable 主要来自超长 traceback（>512 tokens）的截断，\n      而非格式解析失败，性质完全不同于 Qwen 的结构性崩溃。\n      \n      预测 CWM accuracy 65.6% 略高于 CLS 63.5%（gap = -2.1pp，CWM 赢）的理由：\n      (4) DeepSeek 的 code generation 能力本就强于 code classification——\n      在 func-level 已观察到 CWM s123 87.88% > CLS s123 86.77%；\n      (5) CWM 通过生成执行输出再判断 pass/fail，实质上是 chain-of-thought，\n      对于 DeepSeek 这类 generation-oriented 模型更自然；\n      (6) CLS 的 1-token 输出在 DeepSeek 上反而可能丢失了有助推理的中间步骤。\n      \n      这是 worst tier 最具颠覆性的结果：CWM 在 DeepSeek 上 works，\n      直接推翻 'CWM inherently fails at repo-level' 的 narrative。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"DeepSeek vs Qwen: Repo-Level CWM Unparseable Rate\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"Unparseable %\", \"Accuracy\", \"Fail F1\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Qwen3-4B (v10, tok64)\", \"93.0%\", \"69.9%\", \"11.5%\"]\n          - [\"Qwen3-4B (v12, tok1024)\", \"53.7%\", \"58.0%\", \"34.1%\"]\n          - [\"DeepSeek-6.7B (worst)\", \"11.8%\", \"65.6%\", \"30.2%\"]\n      - name: \"DeepSeek Repo-Level CLS vs CWM Head-to-Head\"\n        columns: [\"Formulation\", \"Accuracy\", \"Fail F1\", \"Unparseable\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"CLS\", \"63.5%\", \"38.7%\", \"1.8%\"]\n          - [\"CWM\", \"65.6%\", \"30.2%\", \"11.8%\"]\n          - [\"Gap (CLS - CWM)\", \"-2.1pp\", \"+8.5pp\", \"-10.0pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"CWM unparseable rate 对比图：Qwen 各版本 vs DeepSeek，bar chart 显示量级差异\"\n      - \"DeepSeek CWM 生成长度分布 histogram vs Qwen，展示 token efficiency 差异\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是 worst tier 的 smoking gun。DeepSeek CWM unparseable 仅 11.8%，\n      直接证明 Qwen CWM repo-level 失败是 tokenizer/model-specific artifact，\n      而非 CWM formulation 的固有缺陷。CLS-CWM gap = -2.1pp（CWM 略优），\n      完全消解了 'CLS scales better with complexity' 的 claim。\n      Fail F1 上 CLS 仍高于 CWM（38.7% vs 30.2%），但两者都极低，\n      说明 repo-level minority class prediction 是 model capability 问题而非 formulation 问题。\n      Reframe：formulation choice 的影响被 model family 差异 dominated。\n\n  - name: \"DeepSeek Repo-Level Trajectory Training & Evaluation\"\n    plan_id: \"deepseek-traj-repo\"\n    description: >\n      DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B LoRA trajectory-level (resolved/unresolved) 在 SWE-bench-PerTest 上训练。\n      Worst tier 预测 trajectory 与 per-test CLS 的 variant-level gap 在 [0, 8]pp 内。\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy: 59.3\n      f1_macro: 48.5\n      f1_resolved: 35.2\n      f1_unresolved: 61.8\n      per_test_consistency: 68.4\n      majority_baseline: 53.59\n      gap_vs_majority_pp: 5.71\n      ds_cls_traj_variant_abs_gap_pp: 4.2\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst tier: ds_cls_traj_variant_abs_gap_pp ∈ [0, 8]。预测 4.2pp 的理由：\n      (1) Trajectory-level 将所有 test 信息压缩为单一 resolved/unresolved 判断，\n      丢失了 per-test signal，但也避免了在每个 test 上独立出错——\n      对于 DeepSeek 这种 repo-level 本身就弱的模型，trajectory 聚合反而更稳定；\n      (2) 59.3% trajectory accuracy 看似低，但 majority baseline 仅 53.59%\n      （repo-level 的 resolved/unresolved 更平衡），gap 5.71pp 说明模型学到了有效信号；\n      (3) CLS 63.5% 对应 variant-level accuracy 需要从 per-test 聚合到 variant——\n      per-test 87.5% func-level accuracy 在 block-correlated 误差下\n      variant-level 会打折，预期 CLS variant-level ~63.5%；\n      (4) 4.2pp gap 方向是 CLS > TRAJ，但幅度modest，\n      与 Qwen func-level 的 TOST 等价结果（-0.45pp）形成对比——\n      说明 complexity 增加后 per-test formulation 有轻微优势但不显著。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"DeepSeek Repo-Level: 3 Formulations\"\n        columns: [\"Formulation\", \"Accuracy\", \"Majority Gap\", \"Variant-level Acc (est.)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"CLS (per-test)\", \"63.5%\", \"-9.46pp\", \"~63.5%\"]\n          - [\"CWM (per-test)\", \"65.6%\", \"-7.36pp\", \"~65.6%\"]\n          - [\"TRAJ (variant-level)\", \"59.3%\", \"+5.71pp\", \"59.3%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"3-formulation × 2-model-family radar chart，展示 Qwen vs DeepSeek 的 formulation preference 翻转\"\n    analysis: >\n      DeepSeek repo-level 三格式对比显示无明确 winner：CWM 65.6% > CLS 63.5% > TRAJ 59.3%，\n      但所有模型都远低于 Qwen 最佳（CLS 82.35%）。关键发现：\n      (1) formulation ordering 在 DeepSeek 上是 CWM > CLS > TRAJ，\n      与 Qwen 上的 CLS > TRAJ > CWM（CWM 崩溃）完全不同；\n      (2) 这证明 formulation effectiveness 高度依赖 model architecture/pretraining，\n      支撑 reframe 为 'formulation design space characterization'。\n\n  - name: \"DeepSeek Repo-Level Trajectory Seed123\"\n    plan_id: \"deepseek-traj-repo-s123\"\n    description: >\n      DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B trajectory repo-level 第二 seed，验证 repo-level trajectory 结果稳定性。\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy: 61.2\n      f1_macro: 50.8\n      f1_resolved: 38.4\n      f1_unresolved: 63.2\n      per_test_consistency: 70.1\n      seed_gap_vs_s42_pp: 1.9\n    result_rationale: >\n      Seed123 略高于 seed42（+1.9pp），反映 DeepSeek 在 repo-level 训练的高方差。\n      Worst tier 下 seed variance ~2pp 不算异常（Qwen func-level seed std=0.96pp，\n      repo-level 预期更高）。两 seed mean ≈ 60.3%，仍远低于 majority baseline 73%，\n      确认 DeepSeek repo-level 整体弱势不是 seed accident。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      两 seed 一致地低于 majority baseline，排除了 seed 侥幸的可能性。\n      Mean 60.3% 可稳定地 claim DeepSeek repo-level 三种 formulation 都远弱于 Qwen。\n\n  - name: \"DeepSeek Func-Level Trajectory (corrected evaluation)\"\n    plan_id: \"deepseek-traj-func-v2-fixed\"\n    description: >\n      修正 deepseek-traj-func-v2 的评估 pipeline（原版可能有 label mapping 或 eval 脚本 bug），\n      获得可靠的 DeepSeek func-level trajectory accuracy 用于三格式对比。\n    expected_results:\n      seed42_accuracy: 83.8\n      seed42_majority_baseline: 53.59\n      seed123_accuracy: 85.5\n      seed123_per_test_consistency: 78.8\n      mean_accuracy: 84.7\n      ds_func_cls_traj_gap_pp: 2.2\n      ds_func_cwm_traj_gap_pp: 2.1\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst tier 下 DeepSeek func trajectory accuracy ~84.7%（2-seed mean）。\n      对比 CLS 86.85% 和 CWM 86.83%，trajectory 低约 2pp——\n      这与 Qwen func-level 的 TOST 等价结果不同，DeepSeek 上 trajectory 略弱。\n      原因：(1) deepseek-traj-func-v2 的原始 83.24%/85.08% 可能包含 eval bug，\n      修正后应在相似范围但更准确；\n      (2) DeepSeek-Coder 的 classification head 和 generation head\n      都优于 trajectory aggregation——对 code 专用模型这是合理的，\n      因为 per-test signal 更匹配其 code-level reasoning 训练分布。\n      在 worst tier 叙事中，2.2pp gap 不足以 claim per-test > trajectory，\n      但方向一致性（CLS ≈ CWM > TRAJ 在两个模型族上都成立）可作为 modest finding。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"DeepSeek Func-Level: 3 Formulations (2-seed mean)\"\n        columns: [\"Formulation\", \"Mean Acc\", \"Std\", \"vs TRAJ gap\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"CLS\", \"86.85%\", \"0.11\", \"+2.15pp\"]\n          - [\"CWM\", \"86.83%\", \"1.49\", \"+2.13pp\"]\n          - [\"TRAJ\", \"84.7%\", \"1.20\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Func-level 3-formulation accuracy bar chart with error bars，两 model family 并排\"\n    analysis: >\n      DeepSeek func-level 确认 per-test formulation（CLS 和 CWM 均）优于 trajectory ~2pp，\n      但 CLS 与 CWM 之间无显著差异（gap +0.02pp）。\n      与 Qwen 的 pattern 对比：Qwen-8B CLS-CWM gap=2.43pp，DeepSeek gap≈0pp——\n      这是 worst tier 的核心论据之一：CLS advantage 是 Qwen-specific。\n\n  - name: \"Diagnostic Re-Repair Experiment (Full Scale)\"\n    plan_id: \"diagnostic-rerepair\"\n    description: >\n      200 instances 上测试 per-test failure predictions 作为 diagnostic signal\n      能否提升 repair agent 的 resolve rate。使用 SWE-agent 或类似框架，\n      对比 4 个条件：control（无 diagnostic）、CLS diagnostic、oracle diagnostic、random diagnostic。\n    expected_results:\n      n_instances: 200\n      n_candidates_per_instance: 16\n      control_resolve_rate: 0.175\n      cls_diagnostic_resolve_rate: 0.180\n      oracle_diagnostic_resolve_rate: 0.215\n      random_diagnostic_resolve_rate: 0.145\n      cls_vs_control_delta: 0.005\n      cls_vs_control_p_value: 0.72\n      oracle_vs_control_delta: 0.040\n      oracle_vs_control_p_value: 0.11\n      mean_repair_attempts_per_instance: 3.2\n      wall_clock_hours: 48\n      api_cost_usd: 380\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst tier 核心假设：re-repair 负面。Phase0 已观察到 negative signal\n      （control 0.82 vs cls_diag 0.818 similarity，N=10）。扩展到 200 instances 后：\n      (1) CLS diagnostic 的 12.5% per-test error rate 使得 diagnostic signal 含噪量高——\n      repair agent 收到的 'test X fails' 信息中约 1/8 是错的，导致修复方向误导；\n      (2) 即使 diagnostic 正确，current LLM repair agents（SWE-agent 等）\n      主要依赖 error message / traceback 定位问题，binary pass/fail per test 的增量信息有限——\n      agent 已经从 execution output 获得了更丰富的 diagnostic；\n      (3) CLS-control delta 仅 0.5pp（180 vs 175 resolve），p=0.72 远非显著；\n      (4) Oracle diagnostic 也仅 +4pp（215 vs 175），p=0.11——\n      即使 perfect per-test prediction 也无法显著提升 resolve rate，\n      因为瓶颈在 patch generation 而非 failure localization；\n      (5) Random diagnostic 反而降低 resolve rate（145），\n      说明错误的 diagnostic signal 有害——这是唯一有统计显著性的对比。\n      \n      这个 negative result 意味着 Claim 2 的 'actionable diagnostic information'\n      无法通过 downstream task 验证，只能保留为 'potential utility' 的 theoretical argument。\n      Reviewer Critical #3（'no practical downstream impact'）未被回应。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Re-Repair Resolve Rate by Condition\"\n        columns: [\"Condition\", \"Resolve Rate\", \"Δ vs Control\", \"p-value\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Control (no diagnostic)\", \"17.5%\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"CLS diagnostic\", \"18.0%\", \"+0.5pp\", \"0.72\"]\n          - [\"Oracle diagnostic\", \"21.5%\", \"+4.0pp\", \"0.11\"]\n          - [\"Random diagnostic\", \"14.5%\", \"-3.0pp\", \"0.04*\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"4 条件 resolve rate bar chart with 95% CI error bars，虚线标注 control baseline\"\n      - \"Per-instance scatter：x=CLS diagnostic accuracy, y=resolve improvement，无显著正相关\"\n    analysis: >\n      Re-repair 实验确认 negative：per-test diagnostic 对 repair agent 的实际增益不显著。\n      在 worst tier narrative 中，此结果被 honestly report 为 limitation，\n      但 spin 为 'the bottleneck is generation quality, not failure localization'——\n      呼应整篇论文从 classification vs generation 转向 formulation design space 的主题。\n      Random diagnostic 的负效应（-3pp, p=0.04）可作为 negative finding 的 insight：\n      错误的细粒度 signal 比无 signal 更有害，supporting conservative deployment guidance。\n\n  - name: \"Cross-Model Error Complementarity Analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"error-complementarity-deepseek\"\n    description: >\n      扩展 Qwen CLS/CWM error complementarity 分析到 DeepSeek 模型族。\n      在 func-level 上分析 DeepSeek CLS 和 CWM 的错误模式是否同样互补，\n      计算 oracle ensemble accuracy 和 error type 分布。\n      这是 worst tier 下 pivot 路径 (B) 的核心 supporting experiment。\n    expected_results:\n      ds_func_cls_miss_bug_rate: 0.12\n      ds_func_cls_false_alarm_rate: 0.13\n      ds_func_cwm_miss_bug_rate: 0.07\n      ds_func_cwm_false_alarm_rate: 0.22\n      ds_oracle_ensemble_accuracy: 89.2\n      ds_oracle_vs_best_single_pp: 2.35\n      qwen_oracle_ensemble_accuracy: 90.63\n      qwen_oracle_vs_best_single_pp: 3.12\n      cross_model_error_overlap_pct: 62.4\n      ds_cls_cwm_error_kappa: 0.31\n      qwen_cls_cwm_error_kappa: 0.24\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst tier 下 error complementarity 是最 robust 的 contribution。\n      (1) DeepSeek CLS/CWM 错误互补度预计略低于 Qwen（kappa=0.31 vs 0.24），\n      因为 DeepSeek CLS-CWM accuracy gap 更小（0.02pp vs 2.43pp），\n      两者 error pattern 更相似；\n      (2) 但互补性仍存在：CLS 倾向于 false negatives（miss bugs），\n      CWM 倾向于 false positives（false alarms）——这是 formulation 结构性差异\n      （classify binary vs generate-then-match）导致的，不依赖于 model family；\n      (3) DeepSeek oracle ensemble 89.2% 低于 Qwen 的 90.63%，\n      因为 base accuracy 更低（86.85% vs 90.48%）；\n      (4) 关键 finding：oracle lift 在两个模型族上一致存在（+2-3pp），\n      证明 formulation diversity 作为 verification strategy 的 model-agnostic 价值。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Error Complementarity: Qwen vs DeepSeek\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Qwen-8B\", \"DeepSeek-6.7B\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"CLS miss-bug rate\", \"75.5%*\", \"~48%\"]\n          - [\"CWM false-alarm rate\", \"83.1%*\", \"~68%\"]\n          - [\"Error Cohen's κ\", 0.24, 0.31]\n          - [\"Oracle ensemble acc\", \"90.63%\", \"89.2%\"]\n          - [\"Oracle lift vs best single\", \"+3.12pp\", \"+2.35pp\"]\n        note: \"* Qwen数字来自8B matched-seed analysis中的error pattern，ratio指错误中的比例而非整体\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"2×2 confusion matrix overlay：CLS vs CWM errors per model family\"\n      - \"Venn diagram of error overlap：CLS-only errors, CWM-only errors, shared errors\"\n    analysis: >\n      Error complementarity 在两个模型族上一致存在，是 worst tier 下最 defensible 的 finding。\n      Oracle lift +2-3pp 虽不算大，但其 model-agnostic 性质使其成为 generalizable insight。\n      在 reframed paper 中，此分析支撑 'formulation diversity as verification strategy'\n      的核心 argument，替代原本的 'CLS superiority' claim。\n\n  - name: \"Efficiency Comparison: CLS vs CWM Inference Cost\"\n    plan_id: \"efficiency-comparison\"\n    description: >\n      量化 CLS（1-token output）vs CWM（N-token output）在精度相当时的推理效率差异。\n      测量 FLOPs/sample、wall-time latency、throughput（samples/sec），\n      在 func-level（Qwen-4B、8B、DeepSeek-6.7B）和 repo-level（Qwen-4B）上。\n      这是 worst tier pivot 路径 (A) 的核心实验。\n    expected_results:\n      func_4b_cls_latency_ms: 45\n      func_4b_cwm_latency_ms: 380\n      func_4b_cwm_mean_output_tokens: 28.5\n      func_4b_speedup_ratio: 8.4\n      func_8b_cls_latency_ms: 78\n      func_8b_cwm_latency_ms: 520\n      func_8b_speedup_ratio: 6.7\n      func_ds_cls_latency_ms: 65\n      func_ds_cwm_latency_ms: 410\n      func_ds_speedup_ratio: 6.3\n      repo_4b_cls_latency_ms: 320\n      repo_4b_cwm_latency_ms: 2850\n      repo_4b_speedup_ratio: 8.9\n      throughput_cls_samples_per_sec: 22.2\n      throughput_cwm_samples_per_sec: 2.6\n      flops_ratio_cls_vs_cwm: 0.12\n      batch_efficiency_cls_bs64: true\n      batch_efficiency_cwm_bs64: false\n      cwm_max_batch_size_24gb: 8\n      cls_max_batch_size_24gb: 64\n    result_rationale: >\n      CLS 输出单 token，CWM 输出 N tokens（func mean ~28.5, repo mean ~85）。\n      (1) Autoregressive decoding 的 latency 与 output length 近似线性——\n      CLS 的 prefill + 1 decode step vs CWM 的 prefill + N decode steps，\n      speedup ≈ N（略小因 prefill 是 shared cost）；\n      (2) Func-level CWM mean output ~28.5 tokens → speedup ~8.4x（扣除 prefill overhead）；\n      (3) Repo-level context 更长（seq 8192），prefill 占比更大，\n      但 CWM output 也更长（~85 tokens），speedup 仍 ~8.9x；\n      (4) Batch efficiency 差异更大：CLS 固定 1-token output 可用 large batch，\n      CWM 的 variable-length output 导致 padding waste 和 memory unpredictability；\n      (5) FLOPs ratio ~0.12 意味着 CLS 每 sample 仅用 CWM 12% 的计算量。\n      \n      在 worst tier 下，accuracy 相当（DeepSeek CLS 86.85% ≈ CWM 86.83%）时，\n      8.4x speedup 成为选择 CLS 的 sole justification——\n      不再是 'better accuracy AND faster'，而是 'same accuracy, much faster'。\n      这是 legitimate 但 less exciting 的 contribution。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Inference Efficiency: CLS vs CWM\"\n        columns: [\"Setting\", \"CLS Latency\", \"CWM Latency\", \"Speedup\", \"CLS Acc\", \"CWM Acc\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Func Qwen-4B\", \"45ms\", \"380ms\", \"8.4×\", \"87.83%\", \"87.51%\"]\n          - [\"Func Qwen-8B\", \"78ms\", \"520ms\", \"6.7×\", \"90.48%\", \"87.67%\"]\n          - [\"Func DeepSeek\", \"65ms\", \"410ms\", \"6.3×\", \"86.85%\", \"86.83%\"]\n          - [\"Repo Qwen-4B\", \"320ms\", \"2850ms\", \"8.9×\", \"82.35%\", \"~58%*\"]\n        note: \"* Qwen repo CWM 93% unparseable; effective accuracy on parseable only\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Pareto frontier: accuracy vs latency scatter plot，CLS 和 CWM 分别标记，across all model sizes\"\n      - \"Throughput bar chart: samples/sec at batch sizes 1, 8, 32, 64\"\n    analysis: >\n      Efficiency 是 worst tier 下 CLS 唯一稳定的 selling point。8.4x speedup\n      在 verification-as-ranking 场景中有实际价值（排序 K=100 candidates 时\n      CLS 需 4.5s vs CWM 38s）。但 reviewer 可能认为 'faster inference of shorter output'\n      是 trivially obvious，需要强调 batch efficiency 和 memory predictability 的工程价值。\n\n  - name: \"Systematic 3×2×2 Formulation Comparison Table\"\n    plan_id: \"systematic-comparison\"\n    description: >\n      汇总 3-formulation（CLS, CWM, TRAJ）× 2-model-family（Qwen, DeepSeek）×\n      2-complexity（func, repo）的完整实验矩阵，作为 empirical characterization 的核心贡献。\n      这是 worst tier pivot 路径 (C) 的汇总表。\n    expected_results:\n      qwen4b_func_cls_acc: 87.83\n      qwen4b_func_cwm_acc: 87.51\n      qwen4b_func_traj_acc: 85.66\n      qwen8b_func_cls_acc: 90.48\n      qwen8b_func_cwm_acc: 87.67\n      qwen8b_func_traj_acc: 87.31\n      qwen4b_repo_cls_acc: 82.35\n      qwen4b_repo_cwm_acc: 58.04\n      qwen4b_repo_traj_acc: null\n      qwen8b_repo_cls_acc: 84.79\n      qwen8b_repo_cwm_acc: null\n      qwen8b_repo_traj_acc: null\n      ds_func_cls_acc: 86.85\n      ds_func_cwm_acc: 86.83\n      ds_func_traj_acc: 84.7\n      ds_repo_cls_acc: 63.5\n      ds_repo_cwm_acc: 65.6\n      ds_repo_traj_acc: 59.3\n      formulation_rank_qwen_func: \"CLS > CWM ≈ TRAJ\"\n      formulation_rank_qwen_repo: \"CLS >> CWM (崩溃)\"\n      formulation_rank_ds_func: \"CLS ≈ CWM > TRAJ\"\n      formulation_rank_ds_repo: \"CWM > CLS > TRAJ\"\n      interaction_effect_significant: true\n      model_main_effect_pp: 8.2\n      formulation_main_effect_pp: 3.1\n      complexity_main_effect_pp: 18.4\n    result_rationale: >\n      这张表是 worst tier 论文的 centerpiece。关键观察：\n      (1) Formulation × Model interaction：Qwen 上 CLS > CWM（8B: +2.81pp），\n      DeepSeek 上 CLS ≈ CWM（func: +0.02pp）甚至 CWM > CLS（repo: -2.1pp）——\n      formulation preference 取决于 model family，不存在 universal winner；\n      (2) Complexity main effect 最大（~18pp func→repo drop），\n      说明 task complexity 是 accuracy 的主要 driver，formulation choice 的影响相对次要（~3pp）；\n      (3) Model main effect ~8pp 说明 base model capability 比 formulation 更重要；\n      (4) 交互效应显著：formulation advantage 的方向和大小取决于 model × complexity 组合，\n      这是论文 reframe 为 'design space characterization' 的 empirical foundation。\n      \n      在 worst tier 下，这张表的 message 是 'there is no single best formulation'——\n      必须根据 model 和 task 的特性选择，这本身就是有价值的 empirical insight。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Complete Formulation × Model × Complexity Matrix (Accuracy %)\"\n        columns: [\"\", \"Qwen Func-4B\", \"Qwen Func-8B\", \"Qwen Repo-4B\", \"Qwen Repo-8B\", \"DS Func\", \"DS Repo\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"CLS\", \"87.83\", \"90.48\", \"82.35\", \"84.79\", \"86.85\", \"63.5\"]\n          - [\"CWM\", \"87.51\", \"87.67\", \"58.04†\", \"—\", \"86.83\", \"65.6\"]\n          - [\"TRAJ\", \"85.66\", \"87.31\", \"—\", \"—\", \"84.7\", \"59.3\"]\n        note: \"† 93% unparseable; accuracy计算包含unparseable→majority class; — 未完成\"\n      - name: \"Formulation Ranking by Setting\"\n        columns: [\"Setting\", \"Ranking\", \"Max Gap\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Qwen Func-4B\", \"CLS ≈ CWM > TRAJ\", \"2.17pp\"]\n          - [\"Qwen Func-8B\", \"CLS > CWM ≈ TRAJ\", \"3.17pp\"]\n          - [\"Qwen Repo-4B\", \"CLS >> CWM (broken)\", \"24.31pp\"]\n          - [\"DS Func\", \"CLS ≈ CWM > TRAJ\", \"2.15pp\"]\n          - [\"DS Repo\", \"CWM > CLS > TRAJ\", \"6.3pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Interaction plot: x-axis=complexity (func/repo), y-axis=accuracy, lines=formulations, panels=model families\"\n      - \"Heatmap: formulation × model × complexity matrix with color-coded accuracy\"\n    analysis: >\n      系统比较矩阵揭示了 formulation choice 的条件依赖性。\n      Worst tier 的核心 takeaway：(1) no universal winner across formulations；\n      (2) complexity 是最强 predictor，formulation 是次要因素；\n      (3) model × formulation 交互效应显著，需 per-setting evaluation。\n      作为 'first controlled study of the formulation design space for neural code verification'，\n      这仍有 empirical contribution 价值——但 novelty ceiling 受限于 descriptive nature。\n\n  - name: \"Error Taxonomy & Failure Mode Qualitative Analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"error-taxonomy\"\n    description: >\n      对 CLS 和 CWM 的错误进行系统分类，建立 failure mode taxonomy。\n      手动标注 200 个错误样本（100 CLS + 100 CWM），分类为 5+ 错误类型。\n      这是 worst tier 下补偿 empirical claim 减弱所需的 analysis depth。\n    expected_results:\n      n_annotated_total: 200\n      n_cls_errors: 100\n      n_cwm_errors: 100\n      cls_error_types:\n        logic_misunderstanding: 0.38\n        context_truncation: 0.22\n        label_noise: 0.15\n        edge_case_miss: 0.14\n        spurious_correlation: 0.11\n      cwm_error_types:\n        output_format_mismatch: 0.31\n        numeric_precision: 0.24\n        string_encoding: 0.18\n        execution_path_error: 0.16\n        hallucinated_output: 0.11\n      inter_annotator_agreement_kappa: 0.72\n      cls_cwm_error_type_overlap: 0.15\n    result_rationale: >\n      Error taxonomy 在 worst tier 下 serves two purposes：\n      (1) 补偿 quantitative claim 的减弱——当 'CLS is better' 不成立时，\n      understanding WHY each formulation fails 成为独立 contribution；\n      (2) 为 error complementarity argument 提供 mechanistic explanation。\n      \n      CLS 错误以 logic misunderstanding（38%）和 context truncation（22%）为主——\n      这是因为 CLS 只看 (code, test) 不看 execution output，\n      当 logic 复杂或 context 不足时无法推断 pass/fail。\n      CWM 错误以 output format mismatch（31%）和 numeric precision（24%）为主——\n      CWM 需要精确生成执行输出字符串，任何格式/精度偏差都导致 mismatch。\n      \n      Error type overlap 仅 15% 解释了为什么 oracle ensemble 能提升——\n      两种 formulation 在不同类型的样本上失败，组合后覆盖更多 corner cases。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Error Taxonomy Distribution\"\n        columns: [\"Error Type\", \"CLS %\", \"CWM %\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Logic misunderstanding\", \"38%\", \"16%\"]\n          - [\"Context truncation\", \"22%\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Output format mismatch\", \"—\", \"31%\"]\n          - [\"Numeric precision\", \"—\", \"24%\"]\n          - [\"String encoding\", \"—\", \"18%\"]\n          - [\"Label noise\", \"15%\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Edge case miss\", \"14%\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Execution path error\", \"—\", \"16%\"]\n          - [\"Spurious correlation\", \"11%\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Hallucinated output\", \"—\", \"11%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Stacked bar chart: CLS vs CWM error type 分布对比\"\n      - \"示例 case study panels (3 CLS errors + 3 CWM errors) with annotations\"\n    analysis: >\n      Error taxonomy 提供了 formulation difference 的 mechanistic understanding，\n      是 worst tier paper 的必要补充。CLS-CWM error type overlap 仅 15%\n      是 oracle ensemble improvement 的直接 explanation。\n      这类定性分析在 EMNLP Findings 中被 reviewer 视为 'careful analysis'，\n      部分补偿 quantitative claims 的不足。\n\n  - name: \"Complexity Proxy Regression Analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"complexity-proxy-regression\"\n    description: >\n      建立 code complexity proxy（cyclomatic complexity, LOC, nesting depth, test count）\n      与 formulation preference（CLS-CWM accuracy gap）之间的回归模型。\n      验证 complexity-dependent advantage 是否在控制 model family 后仍可观察。\n    expected_results:\n      n_instances_func: 1890\n      n_instances_repo: 9784\n      func_regression_r2: 0.04\n      func_complexity_coeff: 0.003\n      func_complexity_p_value: 0.18\n      repo_regression_r2: 0.02\n      repo_complexity_coeff: -0.001\n      repo_complexity_p_value: 0.45\n      interaction_model_family_coeff: 0.012\n      interaction_p_value: 0.03\n      best_single_predictor: \"model_family\"\n      best_single_predictor_r2: 0.08\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst tier 下 complexity proxy regression 结果 weak：\n      (1) Func-level R²=0.04 说明 code complexity 仅解释 4% 的 CLS-CWM gap variance——\n      complexity-dependent advantage 在 individual instance level 不可预测；\n      (2) Func complexity coefficient p=0.18，不显著——\n      虽然 aggregate level 上 4B→8B→repo 显示 complexity gradient，\n      但 within-level 的 instance-by-instance complexity 对 formulation preference 无显著影响；\n      (3) Repo-level regression 更弱（R²=0.02），因为 DeepSeek 上 CWM > CLS\n      与 Qwen 上 CLS > CWM 互相抵消；\n      (4) Model family 交互项 p=0.03 是唯一显著 predictor，\n      再次确认 formulation preference 由 model family 而非 complexity 决定。\n      \n      这个 negative result 是 worst tier 的关键 evidence：\n      'complexity-dependent' framing 不成立，应改为 'model-contingent'。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Regression: Complexity Proxy → CLS-CWM Gap\"\n        columns: [\"Predictor\", \"Coeff\", \"p-value\", \"R²\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Cyclomatic complexity\", \"0.003\", \"0.18\", \"0.04\"]\n          - [\"LOC\", \"0.001\", \"0.32\", \"0.02\"]\n          - [\"Test count\", \"0.002\", \"0.25\", \"0.03\"]\n          - [\"Model family (binary)\", \"0.012\", \"0.03*\", \"0.08\"]\n          - [\"Complexity × Model interaction\", \"0.008\", \"0.07\", \"0.11\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scatter plot: cyclomatic complexity vs CLS-CWM accuracy gap，分 model family 着色\"\n      - \"Partial dependence plot: complexity proxy 对 formulation preference 的边际效应\"\n    analysis: >\n      Complexity proxy regression 确认 'complexity-dependent advantage' framing 不 robust：\n      instance-level complexity 不是 formulation preference 的显著 predictor，\n      model family 是。在 reframed paper 中，此分析支撑从 C1 'complexity-dependent advantage'\n      到 'model-contingent formulation preference' 的 narrative shift。\n      C1 降格为 Qwen case study，不再 claim generalizability。\n\n  - name: \"Reviewer Critical Response Assessment\"\n    plan_id: \"reviewer-critical-assessment\"\n    description: >\n      评估 4 个 Round 1 Critical 的回应状态。Worst tier: 仅回应 2/4。\n    expected_results:\n      critical_1_func_null_replication:\n        status: \"addressed\"\n        evidence: \"DeepSeek func CLS≈CWM (+0.02pp), confirms null at func-level\"\n        reviewer_satisfaction: \"partial\"\n        note: \"但不支持 complexity-dependent claim\"\n      critical_2_oracle_frontier:\n        status: \"addressed\"\n        evidence: \"Oracle ensemble 89-91% across both model families\"\n        reviewer_satisfaction: \"satisfied\"\n      critical_3_no_downstream_impact:\n        status: \"NOT addressed\"\n        evidence: \"Re-repair negative (delta +0.5pp, p=0.72)\"\n        reviewer_satisfaction: \"unsatisfied\"\n      critical_4_cross_model_validation:\n        status: \"NOT addressed\"\n        evidence: \"DeepSeek shows OPPOSITE pattern (CWM≥CLS), weakens generalizability\"\n        reviewer_satisfaction: \"unsatisfied\"\n      reviewer_critical_addressed: 2\n      reviewer_critical_total: 4\n    result_rationale: >\n      reviewer_critical_addressed ∈ [2, 2] 的具体拆解：\n      \n      Critical 1（func-null replication）被 addressed 但 double-edged：\n      DeepSeek 确认 func-level CLS≈CWM，但同时确认 CLS advantage 不泛化——\n      reviewer 可能视为 'confirmed the null' 而非 'confirmed the claim'。\n      \n      Critical 2（oracle frontier）被充分 addressed：\n      两个模型族一致的 oracle lift (+2-3pp) + error complementarity 分析\n      是 worst tier 下最强的 contribution，reviewer 应接受。\n      \n      Critical 3（no downstream impact）NOT addressed：\n      Re-repair 实验 negative，无法 demonstrate practical utility。\n      这在 worst tier 下只能 honest report 为 future work。\n      \n      Critical 4（cross-model validation）NOT addressed——worse, CONTRADICTED：\n      DeepSeek 显示 CWM ≥ CLS at repo-level，直接 contradict 'CLS advantage generalizes'。\n      Reviewer 将视此为 fatal flaw for original C1 claim。\n      必须 reframe 为 'model-contingent finding' 才能 survive review。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Reviewer Critical Response Status\"\n        columns: [\"Critical\", \"Status\", \"Evidence Quality\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"#1 Func-null replication\", \"Addressed\", \"Confirms null, weakens C1\"]\n          - [\"#2 Oracle frontier\", \"Addressed\", \"Strong, model-agnostic\"]\n          - [\"#3 Downstream impact\", \"NOT addressed\", \"Re-repair negative\"]\n          - [\"#4 Cross-model validation\", \"NOT addressed\", \"Contradicts C1\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      2/4 Critical addressed 意味着 original submission 的 story 无法 survive R2。\n      必须 significantly reframe：C1 从 'universal advantage' 降格为 'Qwen case study'，\n      C3 (oracle + complementarity) 升级为 primary contribution，\n      C2 (TOST equivalence) 保留。新 framing 需要回避 Critical 3/4\n      而非正面回应——这降低了被接受概率，但仍有 Findings 机会。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8505,"cache_read_input_tokens":45582,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8505},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9d47b78a-b580-467b-a50b-701a5443a345","uuid":"dca5a627-ceb7-461a-9165-0cadd939a768"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":435569,"duration_api_ms":436551,"num_turns":4,"result":"```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  大幅 reframe 为 'The Formulation Design Space for Neural Code Verification'。\n  核心假设不泛化：DeepSeek repo CWM unparseable 仅 ~12%（远低于 Qwen 的 53-93%），\n  且 CWM accuracy 与 CLS 相当甚至略优，证明 Qwen repo-level CWM 崩溃是 Qwen tokenizer 特定弱点，\n  而非 generation formulation 的通用问题。Function-level DeepSeek CLS-CWM gap 仅 +0.03pp（2-seed mean），\n  进一步确认 complexity-dependent advantage 是 Qwen-specific artifact。\n  Pivot 路径组合 A+B+C：(A) Efficiency——CLS 1-token vs CWM N-token 精度相当时有 throughput 优势；\n  (B) Error complementarity 升级为第一 contribution；(C) 首个 3-formulation × 2-model-family 系统比较。\n  C1 降格为 Qwen case study，C3 oracle frontier 升级为主 contribution。\n  仍冲 EMNLP Findings，但需显著加强 analytical writing 和 error taxonomy 深度。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"SWE-bench-PerTest Dataset Construction\"\n    plan_id: \"swebench-pertest-data\"\n    description: >\n      Docker re-evaluation of SWE-bench Verified patches 提取 per-test labels。\n      已通过 repo-level 实验系列隐式完成（test 9784, val 9335）。\n      此实验为 infrastructure，不受 tier 影响。\n    expected_results:\n      n_instances_successful: 489\n      n_instances_docker_fail: 11\n      total_test_samples: 9784\n      total_val_samples: 9335\n      avg_f2p_tests_per_instance: 3.0\n      median_f2p_tests: 2\n      f2p_T1_pct: 68.7\n      f2p_T2_pct: 19.1\n      f2p_T3plus_pct: 12.2\n      class_balance_pass_pct: 72.96\n      class_balance_fail_pct: 27.04\n      docker_wall_clock_hours: 18.5\n      label_agreement_with_original_pct: 98.7\n    result_rationale: >\n      数据集构建是确定性 infrastructure 工作，不受模型性能 tier 影响。489/500 成功率来自\n      SWE-bench Verified 的质量筛选保障；11 个失败源于极老 repo 的 Python 3.7 依赖和\n      C extension 编译问题。F2P 分布（median=2, mean=3）与 SWE-bench Verified 已知统计一致。\n      类别不平衡 72.96% pass 与 repo-level-cls-v5 的 majority baseline 吻合。\n      在 worst tier 下，数据集本身仍是有价值的 resource contribution——\n      区别在于基于此数据集训练的模型表现如何。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"SWE-bench-PerTest Dataset Statistics\"\n        columns: [\"Statistic\", \"Value\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Instances (successful)\", 489]\n          - [\"Total test-level samples\", 9784]\n          - [\"F2P T=1 instances\", \"68.7%\"]\n          - [\"F2P T≥2 instances\", \"31.3%\"]\n          - [\"Class balance (pass%)\", \"72.96%\"]\n          - [\"Label agreement\", \"98.7%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"F2P test count histogram（T=1 到 T=10+），T=1 占 68.7% 的长尾分布\"\n    analysis: >\n      数据集在所有 tier 下表现一致。但在 worst tier 的叙事中，它的角色从 'enabling CLS advantage demonstration'\n      转变为 'enabling systematic formulation comparison'——即 empirical characterization 而非 claim validation。\n\n  - name: \"DeepSeek Repo-Level CLS Training & Evaluation\"\n    plan_id: \"deepseek-cls-repo\"\n    description: >\n      DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B LoRA classification 在 SWE-bench-PerTest repo-level 数据上训练。\n      seq_length=8192。验证 CLS formulation 是否在 Qwen 之外的 model family 同样有效。\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy: 63.5\n      f1_macro: 55.2\n      f1_fail: 38.7\n      f1_pass: 71.8\n      precision_fail: 42.3\n      recall_fail: 35.7\n      precision_pass: 70.1\n      recall_pass: 73.6\n      majority_baseline: 72.96\n      gap_vs_majority_pp: -9.46\n      unparseable_pct: 1.8\n      best_checkpoint: \"checkpoint-400\"\n      training_loss_final: 0.48\n      eval_loss_best: 0.52\n      overfitting_observed: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst tier 核心假设：ds_repo_cls_acc_pct ∈ [55, 70]。预测 63.5% 的理由：\n      (1) DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B 虽在代码理解上强于 Qwen-4B，但 repo-level context 的\n      长序列推理仍是本质难题——Qwen-4B 最佳也仅 83.6%（ckpt4600, val5120），\n      而 DeepSeek 缺乏 Qwen 在 thinking mode 下的 chain-of-thought 优势；\n      (2) DeepSeek tokenizer 对 Python 代码的 token 效率略低于 Qwen3 tokenizer，\n      同等 seq_length 下能容纳的有效上下文更少；\n      (3) LoRA rank=16 对 6.7B 模型的参数覆盖率低于对 4B 模型，\n      导致 adaptation 不充分——这与 Qwen-8B repo-level（ckpt200 仅 63.5%，需大量 step）一致；\n      (4) 63.5% 低于 majority baseline 73%，意味着模型实质上在 randomly guessing\n      minority class，fail_f1 仅 38.7% 反映了极度不平衡的预测分布。\n      这个结果的最大影响：repo-level CLS 并非 universally effective，\n      需要 model-specific tuning，削弱 'CLS as general formulation' 的 claim。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"DeepSeek Repo-Level CLS vs Qwen Repo-Level CLS\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"Accuracy\", \"Fail F1\", \"Pass F1\", \"vs Majority\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Qwen3-4B (ckpt4600)\", \"82.35%\", \"60.87%\", \"88.60%\", \"+9.39pp\"]\n          - [\"Qwen3-8B (ckpt1000)\", \"88.23%*\", \"73.00%*\", \"92.50%*\", \"+15.27pp*\"]\n          - [\"DeepSeek-6.7B (worst)\", \"63.5%\", \"38.7%\", \"71.8%\", \"-9.46pp\"]\n        note: \"* val set numbers; test 可能更低\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"三模型 repo-level accuracy 对比柱状图，DeepSeek 低于 majority baseline 的 red line\"\n      - \"Checkpoint sweep 学习曲线：DeepSeek 过拟合早于 Qwen\"\n    analysis: >\n      DeepSeek repo-level CLS 远低于 Qwen 同级别模型，且低于 majority baseline，\n      证明 CLS formulation 的有效性高度依赖 base model 的 code understanding 能力分布。\n      这直接挑战 C1 的 'classification scales better with complexity' claim——\n      它仅在 Qwen 家族上成立。在 worst tier 叙事中，此结果被重新解读为\n      'formulation effectiveness is model-contingent'，强化 empirical characterization 价值。\n\n  - name: \"DeepSeek Repo-Level CWM Training & Evaluation\"\n    plan_id: \"deepseek-cwm-repo\"\n    description: >\n      DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B LoRA CWM generation 在 SWE-bench-PerTest repo-level 上训练。\n      Worst tier 关键翻转：CWM 在 DeepSeek 上 unparseable rate 极低（<15%），\n      证明 Qwen CWM 崩溃是 tokenizer-specific 而非 formulation-inherent。\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy: 65.6\n      f1_macro: 50.8\n      f1_fail: 30.2\n      f1_pass: 71.4\n      precision_fail: 35.9\n      recall_fail: 26.1\n      precision_pass: 69.8\n      recall_pass: 73.0\n      majority_baseline: 72.96\n      gap_vs_majority_pp: -7.36\n      unparseable_pct: 11.8\n      unparseable_count: 1155\n      exact_match_rate: 42.3\n      truncated_pct: 3.2\n      best_checkpoint: \"checkpoint-500\"\n      max_new_tokens: 512\n      ds_repo_cls_cwm_gap_pp: -2.1\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst tier 核心假设：ds_repo_cwm_unparseable_pct ∈ [0, 15]，ds_repo_cls_cwm_gap ∈ [-5, 5]。\n      预测 unparseable 仅 11.8% 的理由：\n      (1) DeepSeek-Coder 是专门在大量代码执行 trace 上预训练的，其 tokenizer 对\n      stdout/stderr 格式化输出的编码效率远高于 Qwen3——后者是通用 chat model；\n      (2) Qwen repo-level CWM 失败的核心原因是 Qwen tokenizer 将执行输出中的\n      数字、特殊字符、traceback 格式编码为极多 token（如 v10 的 93% unparseable），\n      而 DeepSeek-Coder tokenizer 的代码 vocab 覆盖了这些 pattern；\n      (3) 11.8% unparseable 主要来自超长 traceback（>512 tokens）的截断，\n      而非格式解析失败，性质完全不同于 Qwen 的结构性崩溃。\n      \n      预测 CWM accuracy 65.6% 略高于 CLS 63.5%（gap = -2.1pp，CWM 赢）的理由：\n      (4) DeepSeek 的 code generation 能力本就强于 code classification——\n      在 func-level 已观察到 CWM s123 87.88% > CLS s123 86.77%；\n      (5) CWM 通过生成执行输出再判断 pass/fail，实质上是 chain-of-thought，\n      对于 DeepSeek 这类 generation-oriented 模型更自然；\n      (6) CLS 的 1-token 输出在 DeepSeek 上反而可能丢失了有助推理的中间步骤。\n      \n      这是 worst tier 最具颠覆性的结果：CWM 在 DeepSeek 上 works，\n      直接推翻 'CWM inherently fails at repo-level' 的 narrative。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"DeepSeek vs Qwen: Repo-Level CWM Unparseable Rate\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"Unparseable %\", \"Accuracy\", \"Fail F1\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Qwen3-4B (v10, tok64)\", \"93.0%\", \"69.9%\", \"11.5%\"]\n          - [\"Qwen3-4B (v12, tok1024)\", \"53.7%\", \"58.0%\", \"34.1%\"]\n          - [\"DeepSeek-6.7B (worst)\", \"11.8%\", \"65.6%\", \"30.2%\"]\n      - name: \"DeepSeek Repo-Level CLS vs CWM Head-to-Head\"\n        columns: [\"Formulation\", \"Accuracy\", \"Fail F1\", \"Unparseable\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"CLS\", \"63.5%\", \"38.7%\", \"1.8%\"]\n          - [\"CWM\", \"65.6%\", \"30.2%\", \"11.8%\"]\n          - [\"Gap (CLS - CWM)\", \"-2.1pp\", \"+8.5pp\", \"-10.0pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"CWM unparseable rate 对比图：Qwen 各版本 vs DeepSeek，bar chart 显示量级差异\"\n      - \"DeepSeek CWM 生成长度分布 histogram vs Qwen，展示 token efficiency 差异\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是 worst tier 的 smoking gun。DeepSeek CWM unparseable 仅 11.8%，\n      直接证明 Qwen CWM repo-level 失败是 tokenizer/model-specific artifact，\n      而非 CWM formulation 的固有缺陷。CLS-CWM gap = -2.1pp（CWM 略优），\n      完全消解了 'CLS scales better with complexity' 的 claim。\n      Fail F1 上 CLS 仍高于 CWM（38.7% vs 30.2%），但两者都极低，\n      说明 repo-level minority class prediction 是 model capability 问题而非 formulation 问题。\n      Reframe：formulation choice 的影响被 model family 差异 dominated。\n\n  - name: \"DeepSeek Repo-Level Trajectory Training & Evaluation\"\n    plan_id: \"deepseek-traj-repo\"\n    description: >\n      DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B LoRA trajectory-level (resolved/unresolved) 在 SWE-bench-PerTest 上训练。\n      Worst tier 预测 trajectory 与 per-test CLS 的 variant-level gap 在 [0, 8]pp 内。\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy: 59.3\n      f1_macro: 48.5\n      f1_resolved: 35.2\n      f1_unresolved: 61.8\n      per_test_consistency: 68.4\n      majority_baseline: 53.59\n      gap_vs_majority_pp: 5.71\n      ds_cls_traj_variant_abs_gap_pp: 4.2\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst tier: ds_cls_traj_variant_abs_gap_pp ∈ [0, 8]。预测 4.2pp 的理由：\n      (1) Trajectory-level 将所有 test 信息压缩为单一 resolved/unresolved 判断，\n      丢失了 per-test signal，但也避免了在每个 test 上独立出错——\n      对于 DeepSeek 这种 repo-level 本身就弱的模型，trajectory 聚合反而更稳定；\n      (2) 59.3% trajectory accuracy 看似低，但 majority baseline 仅 53.59%\n      （repo-level 的 resolved/unresolved 更平衡），gap 5.71pp 说明模型学到了有效信号；\n      (3) CLS 63.5% 对应 variant-level accuracy 需要从 per-test 聚合到 variant——\n      per-test 87.5% func-level accuracy 在 block-correlated 误差下\n      variant-level 会打折，预期 CLS variant-level ~63.5%；\n      (4) 4.2pp gap 方向是 CLS > TRAJ，但幅度modest，\n      与 Qwen func-level 的 TOST 等价结果（-0.45pp）形成对比——\n      说明 complexity 增加后 per-test formulation 有轻微优势但不显著。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"DeepSeek Repo-Level: 3 Formulations\"\n        columns: [\"Formulation\", \"Accuracy\", \"Majority Gap\", \"Variant-level Acc (est.)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"CLS (per-test)\", \"63.5%\", \"-9.46pp\", \"~63.5%\"]\n          - [\"CWM (per-test)\", \"65.6%\", \"-7.36pp\", \"~65.6%\"]\n          - [\"TRAJ (variant-level)\", \"59.3%\", \"+5.71pp\", \"59.3%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"3-formulation × 2-model-family radar chart，展示 Qwen vs DeepSeek 的 formulation preference 翻转\"\n    analysis: >\n      DeepSeek repo-level 三格式对比显示无明确 winner：CWM 65.6% > CLS 63.5% > TRAJ 59.3%，\n      但所有模型都远低于 Qwen 最佳（CLS 82.35%）。关键发现：\n      (1) formulation ordering 在 DeepSeek 上是 CWM > CLS > TRAJ，\n      与 Qwen 上的 CLS > TRAJ > CWM（CWM 崩溃）完全不同；\n      (2) 这证明 formulation effectiveness 高度依赖 model architecture/pretraining，\n      支撑 reframe 为 'formulation design space characterization'。\n\n  - name: \"DeepSeek Repo-Level Trajectory Seed123\"\n    plan_id: \"deepseek-traj-repo-s123\"\n    description: >\n      DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B trajectory repo-level 第二 seed，验证 repo-level trajectory 结果稳定性。\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy: 61.2\n      f1_macro: 50.8\n      f1_resolved: 38.4\n      f1_unresolved: 63.2\n      per_test_consistency: 70.1\n      seed_gap_vs_s42_pp: 1.9\n    result_rationale: >\n      Seed123 略高于 seed42（+1.9pp），反映 DeepSeek 在 repo-level 训练的高方差。\n      Worst tier 下 seed variance ~2pp 不算异常（Qwen func-level seed std=0.96pp，\n      repo-level 预期更高）。两 seed mean ≈ 60.3%，仍远低于 majority baseline 73%，\n      确认 DeepSeek repo-level 整体弱势不是 seed accident。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      两 seed 一致地低于 majority baseline，排除了 seed 侥幸的可能性。\n      Mean 60.3% 可稳定地 claim DeepSeek repo-level 三种 formulation 都远弱于 Qwen。\n\n  - name: \"DeepSeek Func-Level Trajectory (corrected evaluation)\"\n    plan_id: \"deepseek-traj-func-v2-fixed\"\n    description: >\n      修正 deepseek-traj-func-v2 的评估 pipeline（原版可能有 label mapping 或 eval 脚本 bug），\n      获得可靠的 DeepSeek func-level trajectory accuracy 用于三格式对比。\n    expected_results:\n      seed42_accuracy: 83.8\n      seed42_majority_baseline: 53.59\n      seed123_accuracy: 85.5\n      seed123_per_test_consistency: 78.8\n      mean_accuracy: 84.7\n      ds_func_cls_traj_gap_pp: 2.2\n      ds_func_cwm_traj_gap_pp: 2.1\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst tier 下 DeepSeek func trajectory accuracy ~84.7%（2-seed mean）。\n      对比 CLS 86.85% 和 CWM 86.83%，trajectory 低约 2pp——\n      这与 Qwen func-level 的 TOST 等价结果不同，DeepSeek 上 trajectory 略弱。\n      原因：(1) deepseek-traj-func-v2 的原始 83.24%/85.08% 可能包含 eval bug，\n      修正后应在相似范围但更准确；\n      (2) DeepSeek-Coder 的 classification head 和 generation head\n      都优于 trajectory aggregation——对 code 专用模型这是合理的，\n      因为 per-test signal 更匹配其 code-level reasoning 训练分布。\n      在 worst tier 叙事中，2.2pp gap 不足以 claim per-test > trajectory，\n      但方向一致性（CLS ≈ CWM > TRAJ 在两个模型族上都成立）可作为 modest finding。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"DeepSeek Func-Level: 3 Formulations (2-seed mean)\"\n        columns: [\"Formulation\", \"Mean Acc\", \"Std\", \"vs TRAJ gap\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"CLS\", \"86.85%\", \"0.11\", \"+2.15pp\"]\n          - [\"CWM\", \"86.83%\", \"1.49\", \"+2.13pp\"]\n          - [\"TRAJ\", \"84.7%\", \"1.20\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Func-level 3-formulation accuracy bar chart with error bars，两 model family 并排\"\n    analysis: >\n      DeepSeek func-level 确认 per-test formulation（CLS 和 CWM 均）优于 trajectory ~2pp，\n      但 CLS 与 CWM 之间无显著差异（gap +0.02pp）。\n      与 Qwen 的 pattern 对比：Qwen-8B CLS-CWM gap=2.43pp，DeepSeek gap≈0pp——\n      这是 worst tier 的核心论据之一：CLS advantage 是 Qwen-specific。\n\n  - name: \"Diagnostic Re-Repair Experiment (Full Scale)\"\n    plan_id: \"diagnostic-rerepair\"\n    description: >\n      200 instances 上测试 per-test failure predictions 作为 diagnostic signal\n      能否提升 repair agent 的 resolve rate。使用 SWE-agent 或类似框架，\n      对比 4 个条件：control（无 diagnostic）、CLS diagnostic、oracle diagnostic、random diagnostic。\n    expected_results:\n      n_instances: 200\n      n_candidates_per_instance: 16\n      control_resolve_rate: 0.175\n      cls_diagnostic_resolve_rate: 0.180\n      oracle_diagnostic_resolve_rate: 0.215\n      random_diagnostic_resolve_rate: 0.145\n      cls_vs_control_delta: 0.005\n      cls_vs_control_p_value: 0.72\n      oracle_vs_control_delta: 0.040\n      oracle_vs_control_p_value: 0.11\n      mean_repair_attempts_per_instance: 3.2\n      wall_clock_hours: 48\n      api_cost_usd: 380\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst tier 核心假设：re-repair 负面。Phase0 已观察到 negative signal\n      （control 0.82 vs cls_diag 0.818 similarity，N=10）。扩展到 200 instances 后：\n      (1) CLS diagnostic 的 12.5% per-test error rate 使得 diagnostic signal 含噪量高——\n      repair agent 收到的 'test X fails' 信息中约 1/8 是错的，导致修复方向误导；\n      (2) 即使 diagnostic 正确，current LLM repair agents（SWE-agent 等）\n      主要依赖 error message / traceback 定位问题，binary pass/fail per test 的增量信息有限——\n      agent 已经从 execution output 获得了更丰富的 diagnostic；\n      (3) CLS-control delta 仅 0.5pp（180 vs 175 resolve），p=0.72 远非显著；\n      (4) Oracle diagnostic 也仅 +4pp（215 vs 175），p=0.11——\n      即使 perfect per-test prediction 也无法显著提升 resolve rate，\n      因为瓶颈在 patch generation 而非 failure localization；\n      (5) Random diagnostic 反而降低 resolve rate（145），\n      说明错误的 diagnostic signal 有害——这是唯一有统计显著性的对比。\n      \n      这个 negative result 意味着 Claim 2 的 'actionable diagnostic information'\n      无法通过 downstream task 验证，只能保留为 'potential utility' 的 theoretical argument。\n      Reviewer Critical #3（'no practical downstream impact'）未被回应。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Re-Repair Resolve Rate by Condition\"\n        columns: [\"Condition\", \"Resolve Rate\", \"Δ vs Control\", \"p-value\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Control (no diagnostic)\", \"17.5%\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"CLS diagnostic\", \"18.0%\", \"+0.5pp\", \"0.72\"]\n          - [\"Oracle diagnostic\", \"21.5%\", \"+4.0pp\", \"0.11\"]\n          - [\"Random diagnostic\", \"14.5%\", \"-3.0pp\", \"0.04*\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"4 条件 resolve rate bar chart with 95% CI error bars，虚线标注 control baseline\"\n      - \"Per-instance scatter：x=CLS diagnostic accuracy, y=resolve improvement，无显著正相关\"\n    analysis: >\n      Re-repair 实验确认 negative：per-test diagnostic 对 repair agent 的实际增益不显著。\n      在 worst tier narrative 中，此结果被 honestly report 为 limitation，\n      但 spin 为 'the bottleneck is generation quality, not failure localization'——\n      呼应整篇论文从 classification vs generation 转向 formulation design space 的主题。\n      Random diagnostic 的负效应（-3pp, p=0.04）可作为 negative finding 的 insight：\n      错误的细粒度 signal 比无 signal 更有害，supporting conservative deployment guidance。\n\n  - name: \"Cross-Model Error Complementarity Analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"error-complementarity-deepseek\"\n    description: >\n      扩展 Qwen CLS/CWM error complementarity 分析到 DeepSeek 模型族。\n      在 func-level 上分析 DeepSeek CLS 和 CWM 的错误模式是否同样互补，\n      计算 oracle ensemble accuracy 和 error type 分布。\n      这是 worst tier 下 pivot 路径 (B) 的核心 supporting experiment。\n    expected_results:\n      ds_func_cls_miss_bug_rate: 0.12\n      ds_func_cls_false_alarm_rate: 0.13\n      ds_func_cwm_miss_bug_rate: 0.07\n      ds_func_cwm_false_alarm_rate: 0.22\n      ds_oracle_ensemble_accuracy: 89.2\n      ds_oracle_vs_best_single_pp: 2.35\n      qwen_oracle_ensemble_accuracy: 90.63\n      qwen_oracle_vs_best_single_pp: 3.12\n      cross_model_error_overlap_pct: 62.4\n      ds_cls_cwm_error_kappa: 0.31\n      qwen_cls_cwm_error_kappa: 0.24\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst tier 下 error complementarity 是最 robust 的 contribution。\n      (1) DeepSeek CLS/CWM 错误互补度预计略低于 Qwen（kappa=0.31 vs 0.24），\n      因为 DeepSeek CLS-CWM accuracy gap 更小（0.02pp vs 2.43pp），\n      两者 error pattern 更相似；\n      (2) 但互补性仍存在：CLS 倾向于 false negatives（miss bugs），\n      CWM 倾向于 false positives（false alarms）——这是 formulation 结构性差异\n      （classify binary vs generate-then-match）导致的，不依赖于 model family；\n      (3) DeepSeek oracle ensemble 89.2% 低于 Qwen 的 90.63%，\n      因为 base accuracy 更低（86.85% vs 90.48%）；\n      (4) 关键 finding：oracle lift 在两个模型族上一致存在（+2-3pp），\n      证明 formulation diversity 作为 verification strategy 的 model-agnostic 价值。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Error Complementarity: Qwen vs DeepSeek\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Qwen-8B\", \"DeepSeek-6.7B\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"CLS miss-bug rate\", \"75.5%*\", \"~48%\"]\n          - [\"CWM false-alarm rate\", \"83.1%*\", \"~68%\"]\n          - [\"Error Cohen's κ\", 0.24, 0.31]\n          - [\"Oracle ensemble acc\", \"90.63%\", \"89.2%\"]\n          - [\"Oracle lift vs best single\", \"+3.12pp\", \"+2.35pp\"]\n        note: \"* Qwen数字来自8B matched-seed analysis中的error pattern，ratio指错误中的比例而非整体\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"2×2 confusion matrix overlay：CLS vs CWM errors per model family\"\n      - \"Venn diagram of error overlap：CLS-only errors, CWM-only errors, shared errors\"\n    analysis: >\n      Error complementarity 在两个模型族上一致存在，是 worst tier 下最 defensible 的 finding。\n      Oracle lift +2-3pp 虽不算大，但其 model-agnostic 性质使其成为 generalizable insight。\n      在 reframed paper 中，此分析支撑 'formulation diversity as verification strategy'\n      的核心 argument，替代原本的 'CLS superiority' claim。\n\n  - name: \"Efficiency Comparison: CLS vs CWM Inference Cost\"\n    plan_id: \"efficiency-comparison\"\n    description: >\n      量化 CLS（1-token output）vs CWM（N-token output）在精度相当时的推理效率差异。\n      测量 FLOPs/sample、wall-time latency、throughput（samples/sec），\n      在 func-level（Qwen-4B、8B、DeepSeek-6.7B）和 repo-level（Qwen-4B）上。\n      这是 worst tier pivot 路径 (A) 的核心实验。\n    expected_results:\n      func_4b_cls_latency_ms: 45\n      func_4b_cwm_latency_ms: 380\n      func_4b_cwm_mean_output_tokens: 28.5\n      func_4b_speedup_ratio: 8.4\n      func_8b_cls_latency_ms: 78\n      func_8b_cwm_latency_ms: 520\n      func_8b_speedup_ratio: 6.7\n      func_ds_cls_latency_ms: 65\n      func_ds_cwm_latency_ms: 410\n      func_ds_speedup_ratio: 6.3\n      repo_4b_cls_latency_ms: 320\n      repo_4b_cwm_latency_ms: 2850\n      repo_4b_speedup_ratio: 8.9\n      throughput_cls_samples_per_sec: 22.2\n      throughput_cwm_samples_per_sec: 2.6\n      flops_ratio_cls_vs_cwm: 0.12\n      batch_efficiency_cls_bs64: true\n      batch_efficiency_cwm_bs64: false\n      cwm_max_batch_size_24gb: 8\n      cls_max_batch_size_24gb: 64\n    result_rationale: >\n      CLS 输出单 token，CWM 输出 N tokens（func mean ~28.5, repo mean ~85）。\n      (1) Autoregressive decoding 的 latency 与 output length 近似线性——\n      CLS 的 prefill + 1 decode step vs CWM 的 prefill + N decode steps，\n      speedup ≈ N（略小因 prefill 是 shared cost）；\n      (2) Func-level CWM mean output ~28.5 tokens → speedup ~8.4x（扣除 prefill overhead）；\n      (3) Repo-level context 更长（seq 8192），prefill 占比更大，\n      但 CWM output 也更长（~85 tokens），speedup 仍 ~8.9x；\n      (4) Batch efficiency 差异更大：CLS 固定 1-token output 可用 large batch，\n      CWM 的 variable-length output 导致 padding waste 和 memory unpredictability；\n      (5) FLOPs ratio ~0.12 意味着 CLS 每 sample 仅用 CWM 12% 的计算量。\n      \n      在 worst tier 下，accuracy 相当（DeepSeek CLS 86.85% ≈ CWM 86.83%）时，\n      8.4x speedup 成为选择 CLS 的 sole justification——\n      不再是 'better accuracy AND faster'，而是 'same accuracy, much faster'。\n      这是 legitimate 但 less exciting 的 contribution。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Inference Efficiency: CLS vs CWM\"\n        columns: [\"Setting\", \"CLS Latency\", \"CWM Latency\", \"Speedup\", \"CLS Acc\", \"CWM Acc\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Func Qwen-4B\", \"45ms\", \"380ms\", \"8.4×\", \"87.83%\", \"87.51%\"]\n          - [\"Func Qwen-8B\", \"78ms\", \"520ms\", \"6.7×\", \"90.48%\", \"87.67%\"]\n          - [\"Func DeepSeek\", \"65ms\", \"410ms\", \"6.3×\", \"86.85%\", \"86.83%\"]\n          - [\"Repo Qwen-4B\", \"320ms\", \"2850ms\", \"8.9×\", \"82.35%\", \"~58%*\"]\n        note: \"* Qwen repo CWM 93% unparseable; effective accuracy on parseable only\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Pareto frontier: accuracy vs latency scatter plot，CLS 和 CWM 分别标记，across all model sizes\"\n      - \"Throughput bar chart: samples/sec at batch sizes 1, 8, 32, 64\"\n    analysis: >\n      Efficiency 是 worst tier 下 CLS 唯一稳定的 selling point。8.4x speedup\n      在 verification-as-ranking 场景中有实际价值（排序 K=100 candidates 时\n      CLS 需 4.5s vs CWM 38s）。但 reviewer 可能认为 'faster inference of shorter output'\n      是 trivially obvious，需要强调 batch efficiency 和 memory predictability 的工程价值。\n\n  - name: \"Systematic 3×2×2 Formulation Comparison Table\"\n    plan_id: \"systematic-comparison\"\n    description: >\n      汇总 3-formulation（CLS, CWM, TRAJ）× 2-model-family（Qwen, DeepSeek）×\n      2-complexity（func, repo）的完整实验矩阵，作为 empirical characterization 的核心贡献。\n      这是 worst tier pivot 路径 (C) 的汇总表。\n    expected_results:\n      qwen4b_func_cls_acc: 87.83\n      qwen4b_func_cwm_acc: 87.51\n      qwen4b_func_traj_acc: 85.66\n      qwen8b_func_cls_acc: 90.48\n      qwen8b_func_cwm_acc: 87.67\n      qwen8b_func_traj_acc: 87.31\n      qwen4b_repo_cls_acc: 82.35\n      qwen4b_repo_cwm_acc: 58.04\n      qwen4b_repo_traj_acc: null\n      qwen8b_repo_cls_acc: 84.79\n      qwen8b_repo_cwm_acc: null\n      qwen8b_repo_traj_acc: null\n      ds_func_cls_acc: 86.85\n      ds_func_cwm_acc: 86.83\n      ds_func_traj_acc: 84.7\n      ds_repo_cls_acc: 63.5\n      ds_repo_cwm_acc: 65.6\n      ds_repo_traj_acc: 59.3\n      formulation_rank_qwen_func: \"CLS > CWM ≈ TRAJ\"\n      formulation_rank_qwen_repo: \"CLS >> CWM (崩溃)\"\n      formulation_rank_ds_func: \"CLS ≈ CWM > TRAJ\"\n      formulation_rank_ds_repo: \"CWM > CLS > TRAJ\"\n      interaction_effect_significant: true\n      model_main_effect_pp: 8.2\n      formulation_main_effect_pp: 3.1\n      complexity_main_effect_pp: 18.4\n    result_rationale: >\n      这张表是 worst tier 论文的 centerpiece。关键观察：\n      (1) Formulation × Model interaction：Qwen 上 CLS > CWM（8B: +2.81pp），\n      DeepSeek 上 CLS ≈ CWM（func: +0.02pp）甚至 CWM > CLS（repo: -2.1pp）——\n      formulation preference 取决于 model family，不存在 universal winner；\n      (2) Complexity main effect 最大（~18pp func→repo drop），\n      说明 task complexity 是 accuracy 的主要 driver，formulation choice 的影响相对次要（~3pp）；\n      (3) Model main effect ~8pp 说明 base model capability 比 formulation 更重要；\n      (4) 交互效应显著：formulation advantage 的方向和大小取决于 model × complexity 组合，\n      这是论文 reframe 为 'design space characterization' 的 empirical foundation。\n      \n      在 worst tier 下，这张表的 message 是 'there is no single best formulation'——\n      必须根据 model 和 task 的特性选择，这本身就是有价值的 empirical insight。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Complete Formulation × Model × Complexity Matrix (Accuracy %)\"\n        columns: [\"\", \"Qwen Func-4B\", \"Qwen Func-8B\", \"Qwen Repo-4B\", \"Qwen Repo-8B\", \"DS Func\", \"DS Repo\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"CLS\", \"87.83\", \"90.48\", \"82.35\", \"84.79\", \"86.85\", \"63.5\"]\n          - [\"CWM\", \"87.51\", \"87.67\", \"58.04†\", \"—\", \"86.83\", \"65.6\"]\n          - [\"TRAJ\", \"85.66\", \"87.31\", \"—\", \"—\", \"84.7\", \"59.3\"]\n        note: \"† 93% unparseable; accuracy计算包含unparseable→majority class; — 未完成\"\n      - name: \"Formulation Ranking by Setting\"\n        columns: [\"Setting\", \"Ranking\", \"Max Gap\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Qwen Func-4B\", \"CLS ≈ CWM > TRAJ\", \"2.17pp\"]\n          - [\"Qwen Func-8B\", \"CLS > CWM ≈ TRAJ\", \"3.17pp\"]\n          - [\"Qwen Repo-4B\", \"CLS >> CWM (broken)\", \"24.31pp\"]\n          - [\"DS Func\", \"CLS ≈ CWM > TRAJ\", \"2.15pp\"]\n          - [\"DS Repo\", \"CWM > CLS > TRAJ\", \"6.3pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Interaction plot: x-axis=complexity (func/repo), y-axis=accuracy, lines=formulations, panels=model families\"\n      - \"Heatmap: formulation × model × complexity matrix with color-coded accuracy\"\n    analysis: >\n      系统比较矩阵揭示了 formulation choice 的条件依赖性。\n      Worst tier 的核心 takeaway：(1) no universal winner across formulations；\n      (2) complexity 是最强 predictor，formulation 是次要因素；\n      (3) model × formulation 交互效应显著，需 per-setting evaluation。\n      作为 'first controlled study of the formulation design space for neural code verification'，\n      这仍有 empirical contribution 价值——但 novelty ceiling 受限于 descriptive nature。\n\n  - name: \"Error Taxonomy & Failure Mode Qualitative Analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"error-taxonomy\"\n    description: >\n      对 CLS 和 CWM 的错误进行系统分类，建立 failure mode taxonomy。\n      手动标注 200 个错误样本（100 CLS + 100 CWM），分类为 5+ 错误类型。\n      这是 worst tier 下补偿 empirical claim 减弱所需的 analysis depth。\n    expected_results:\n      n_annotated_total: 200\n      n_cls_errors: 100\n      n_cwm_errors: 100\n      cls_error_types:\n        logic_misunderstanding: 0.38\n        context_truncation: 0.22\n        label_noise: 0.15\n        edge_case_miss: 0.14\n        spurious_correlation: 0.11\n      cwm_error_types:\n        output_format_mismatch: 0.31\n        numeric_precision: 0.24\n        string_encoding: 0.18\n        execution_path_error: 0.16\n        hallucinated_output: 0.11\n      inter_annotator_agreement_kappa: 0.72\n      cls_cwm_error_type_overlap: 0.15\n    result_rationale: >\n      Error taxonomy 在 worst tier 下 serves two purposes：\n      (1) 补偿 quantitative claim 的减弱——当 'CLS is better' 不成立时，\n      understanding WHY each formulation fails 成为独立 contribution；\n      (2) 为 error complementarity argument 提供 mechanistic explanation。\n      \n      CLS 错误以 logic misunderstanding（38%）和 context truncation（22%）为主——\n      这是因为 CLS 只看 (code, test) 不看 execution output，\n      当 logic 复杂或 context 不足时无法推断 pass/fail。\n      CWM 错误以 output format mismatch（31%）和 numeric precision（24%）为主——\n      CWM 需要精确生成执行输出字符串，任何格式/精度偏差都导致 mismatch。\n      \n      Error type overlap 仅 15% 解释了为什么 oracle ensemble 能提升——\n      两种 formulation 在不同类型的样本上失败，组合后覆盖更多 corner cases。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Error Taxonomy Distribution\"\n        columns: [\"Error Type\", \"CLS %\", \"CWM %\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Logic misunderstanding\", \"38%\", \"16%\"]\n          - [\"Context truncation\", \"22%\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Output format mismatch\", \"—\", \"31%\"]\n          - [\"Numeric precision\", \"—\", \"24%\"]\n          - [\"String encoding\", \"—\", \"18%\"]\n          - [\"Label noise\", \"15%\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Edge case miss\", \"14%\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Execution path error\", \"—\", \"16%\"]\n          - [\"Spurious correlation\", \"11%\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Hallucinated output\", \"—\", \"11%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Stacked bar chart: CLS vs CWM error type 分布对比\"\n      - \"示例 case study panels (3 CLS errors + 3 CWM errors) with annotations\"\n    analysis: >\n      Error taxonomy 提供了 formulation difference 的 mechanistic understanding，\n      是 worst tier paper 的必要补充。CLS-CWM error type overlap 仅 15%\n      是 oracle ensemble improvement 的直接 explanation。\n      这类定性分析在 EMNLP Findings 中被 reviewer 视为 'careful analysis'，\n      部分补偿 quantitative claims 的不足。\n\n  - name: \"Complexity Proxy Regression Analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"complexity-proxy-regression\"\n    description: >\n      建立 code complexity proxy（cyclomatic complexity, LOC, nesting depth, test count）\n      与 formulation preference（CLS-CWM accuracy gap）之间的回归模型。\n      验证 complexity-dependent advantage 是否在控制 model family 后仍可观察。\n    expected_results:\n      n_instances_func: 1890\n      n_instances_repo: 9784\n      func_regression_r2: 0.04\n      func_complexity_coeff: 0.003\n      func_complexity_p_value: 0.18\n      repo_regression_r2: 0.02\n      repo_complexity_coeff: -0.001\n      repo_complexity_p_value: 0.45\n      interaction_model_family_coeff: 0.012\n      interaction_p_value: 0.03\n      best_single_predictor: \"model_family\"\n      best_single_predictor_r2: 0.08\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst tier 下 complexity proxy regression 结果 weak：\n      (1) Func-level R²=0.04 说明 code complexity 仅解释 4% 的 CLS-CWM gap variance——\n      complexity-dependent advantage 在 individual instance level 不可预测；\n      (2) Func complexity coefficient p=0.18，不显著——\n      虽然 aggregate level 上 4B→8B→repo 显示 complexity gradient，\n      但 within-level 的 instance-by-instance complexity 对 formulation preference 无显著影响；\n      (3) Repo-level regression 更弱（R²=0.02），因为 DeepSeek 上 CWM > CLS\n      与 Qwen 上 CLS > CWM 互相抵消；\n      (4) Model family 交互项 p=0.03 是唯一显著 predictor，\n      再次确认 formulation preference 由 model family 而非 complexity 决定。\n      \n      这个 negative result 是 worst tier 的关键 evidence：\n      'complexity-dependent' framing 不成立，应改为 'model-contingent'。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Regression: Complexity Proxy → CLS-CWM Gap\"\n        columns: [\"Predictor\", \"Coeff\", \"p-value\", \"R²\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Cyclomatic complexity\", \"0.003\", \"0.18\", \"0.04\"]\n          - [\"LOC\", \"0.001\", \"0.32\", \"0.02\"]\n          - [\"Test count\", \"0.002\", \"0.25\", \"0.03\"]\n          - [\"Model family (binary)\", \"0.012\", \"0.03*\", \"0.08\"]\n          - [\"Complexity × Model interaction\", \"0.008\", \"0.07\", \"0.11\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scatter plot: cyclomatic complexity vs CLS-CWM accuracy gap，分 model family 着色\"\n      - \"Partial dependence plot: complexity proxy 对 formulation preference 的边际效应\"\n    analysis: >\n      Complexity proxy regression 确认 'complexity-dependent advantage' framing 不 robust：\n      instance-level complexity 不是 formulation preference 的显著 predictor，\n      model family 是。在 reframed paper 中，此分析支撑从 C1 'complexity-dependent advantage'\n      到 'model-contingent formulation preference' 的 narrative shift。\n      C1 降格为 Qwen case study，不再 claim generalizability。\n\n  - name: \"Reviewer Critical Response Assessment\"\n    plan_id: \"reviewer-critical-assessment\"\n    description: >\n      评估 4 个 Round 1 Critical 的回应状态。Worst tier: 仅回应 2/4。\n    expected_results:\n      critical_1_func_null_replication:\n        status: \"addressed\"\n        evidence: \"DeepSeek func CLS≈CWM (+0.02pp), confirms null at func-level\"\n        reviewer_satisfaction: \"partial\"\n        note: \"但不支持 complexity-dependent claim\"\n      critical_2_oracle_frontier:\n        status: \"addressed\"\n        evidence: \"Oracle ensemble 89-91% across both model families\"\n        reviewer_satisfaction: \"satisfied\"\n      critical_3_no_downstream_impact:\n        status: \"NOT addressed\"\n        evidence: \"Re-repair negative (delta +0.5pp, p=0.72)\"\n        reviewer_satisfaction: \"unsatisfied\"\n      critical_4_cross_model_validation:\n        status: \"NOT addressed\"\n        evidence: \"DeepSeek shows OPPOSITE pattern (CWM≥CLS), weakens generalizability\"\n        reviewer_satisfaction: \"unsatisfied\"\n      reviewer_critical_addressed: 2\n      reviewer_critical_total: 4\n    result_rationale: >\n      reviewer_critical_addressed ∈ [2, 2] 的具体拆解：\n      \n      Critical 1（func-null replication）被 addressed 但 double-edged：\n      DeepSeek 确认 func-level CLS≈CWM，但同时确认 CLS advantage 不泛化——\n      reviewer 可能视为 'confirmed the null' 而非 'confirmed the claim'。\n      \n      Critical 2（oracle frontier）被充分 addressed：\n      两个模型族一致的 oracle lift (+2-3pp) + error complementarity 分析\n      是 worst tier 下最强的 contribution，reviewer 应接受。\n      \n      Critical 3（no downstream impact）NOT addressed：\n      Re-repair 实验 negative，无法 demonstrate practical utility。\n      这在 worst tier 下只能 honest report 为 future work。\n      \n      Critical 4（cross-model validation）NOT addressed——worse, CONTRADICTED：\n      DeepSeek 显示 CWM ≥ CLS at repo-level，直接 contradict 'CLS advantage generalizes'。\n      Reviewer 将视此为 fatal flaw for original C1 claim。\n      必须 reframe 为 'model-contingent finding' 才能 survive review。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Reviewer Critical Response Status\"\n        columns: [\"Critical\", \"Status\", \"Evidence Quality\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"#1 Func-null replication\", \"Addressed\", \"Confirms null, weakens C1\"]\n          - [\"#2 Oracle frontier\", \"Addressed\", \"Strong, model-agnostic\"]\n          - [\"#3 Downstream impact\", \"NOT addressed\", \"Re-repair negative\"]\n          - [\"#4 Cross-model validation\", \"NOT addressed\", \"Contradicts C1\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      2/4 Critical addressed 意味着 original submission 的 story 无法 survive R2。\n      必须 significantly reframe：C1 从 'universal advantage' 降格为 'Qwen case study'，\n      C3 (oracle + complementarity) 升级为 primary contribution，\n      C2 (TOST equivalence) 保留。新 framing 需要回避 Critical 3/4\n      而非正面回应——这降低了被接受概率，但仍有 Findings 机会。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"9d47b78a-b580-467b-a50b-701a5443a345","total_cost_usd":1.01510275,"usage":{"input_tokens":5,"cache_creation_input_tokens":42386,"cache_read_input_tokens":146263,"output_tokens":20955,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":42386,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":20449,"cache_read_input_tokens":45582,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8505,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8505},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":26859,"outputTokens":3760,"cacheReadInputTokens":356985,"cacheCreationInputTokens":57441,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.15315875,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":5,"outputTokens":20955,"cacheReadInputTokens":146263,"cacheCreationInputTokens":42386,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.8619439999999999,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"3a09f79b-ac6e-4e9d-9941-1aead8993e69"}
